load 0.25.\\\",\\\"At tick 13 heating failed because no actual available heat source was within reach.\\\",\\\"At tick 13 inventory contains 6.9 roots and health is 100.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"No heating response or preservation benefit has been measured. Suitable preparation tools and clean supports are not established.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Maintain a modest safe-food reserve and develop a feasible controlled food-processing trial.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Gathered roots and ate one.\\\",\\\"Learned probe.\\\",\\\"Observed the root plant and performed a small press trial.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"Personal root nutrition knowledge and a recorded low-load press response.\\\",\\\"A failed heating attempt established that the required local heat source was unavailable.\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"A feasible preparation method, suitable equipment and actual comparative trial readings.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Ask Sol about trial evidence and request a physically grounded small-sample preparation and drying mechanism.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"Known-safe food remains available; small trials limit material expenditure.\\\"}],\\\"cares\\\":\\\"Staying healthy, learning from real trials, and becoming able to contribute useful knowledge and practical help to nearby people.\\\",\\\"views\\\":{}}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}}

